<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="C4 L1 Контекст" id="d0"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="Контекст системы (C4, уровень 1)" style="fontFamily=Arial;text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="Кто пользуется системой и с какими внешними системами она связана" style="fontFamily=Arial;text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="900" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Гражданин&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Пользователь]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Фотографирует яму, подаёт заявку, следит за её статусом&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;html=1;fontSize=11;dashed=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#073B6F;fontColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.c4.person2;align=center;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="200" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Диспетчер&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Пользователь]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Принимает решения по заявкам, назначает подрядчиков, ведёт справочники, смотрит отчёты&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;html=1;fontSize=11;dashed=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#073B6F;fontColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.c4.person2;align=center;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="390" y="90" width="200" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Подрядчик&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Пользователь]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Ремонтирует назначенные ямы и подтверждает ремонт фото «после»&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;html=1;fontSize=11;dashed=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#073B6F;fontColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.c4.person2;align=center;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="90" width="200" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Сервис подачи заявок «Ямочный ремонт»&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Программная система]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Принимает заявки с фото, оценивает их по ГОСТ Р 50597-2017, назначает подрядчиков и ведёт заявку до ремонта&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#1168BD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#0B4884;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="400" width="300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;OpenStreetMap&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Внешняя система]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Подложка карты; данные улиц и домов Томска&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#999999;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="260" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Firebase Cloud Messaging&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Внешняя система, этап 2]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Доставка push-уведомлений на Android&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#BBBBBB;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;dashed=1;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="650" width="260" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="&lt;b&gt;Подаёт заявки, смотрит статус&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;[мобильное приложение Android]&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1.2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;endSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v3" target="v6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="140" y="437"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="&lt;b&gt;Решает по заявкам, ведёт справочники&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;[веб-приложение]&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1.2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;endSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v4" target="v6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="&lt;b&gt;Видит свои заявки, загружает фото «после»&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;[веб-приложение]&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1.2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;endSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.25;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v5" target="v6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="840" y="437"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="&lt;b&gt;Берёт подложку карты; один раз загружает улицы и дома&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;[HTTPS, Overpass API]&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1.2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;endSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v6" target="v7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="415" y="600"/><mxPoint x="170" y="600"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="&lt;b&gt;Отправляет push&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;[HTTPS]&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1.2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;endSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v6" target="v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="565" y="600"/><mxPoint x="810" y="600"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="C4 L2 Контейнеры" id="d1"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v14" value="Контейнеры системы (C4, уровень 2)" style="fontFamily=Arial;text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15" value="Из каких запускаемых частей состоит система и как они обмениваются данными" style="fontFamily=Arial;text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="1000" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v16" value="&lt;b&gt;Гражданин&lt;/b&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;html=1;fontSize=11;dashed=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#073B6F;fontColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.c4.person2;align=center;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="80" width="110" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v17" value="&lt;b&gt;Диспетчер,&lt;br&gt;подрядчик&lt;/b&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;html=1;fontSize=11;dashed=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#073B6F;fontColor=#ffffff;shape=mxgraph.c4.person2;align=center;points=[[0.5,0,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="80" width="110" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v18" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;OpenStreetMap&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Внешняя система]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Тайлы карты для обоих клиентов; улицы и дома загружаются в БД скриптами один раз&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#999999;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="70" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v19" value="&lt;b&gt;Сервис подачи заявок «Ямочный ремонт»&lt;/b&gt; [Программная система]" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;dashPattern=8 4;absoluteArcSize=1;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="225" width="1200" height="640" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Мобильное приложение&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: Android]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Фото ямы, подача заявки, мои заявки, уведомления (опрос)&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="270" width="250" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Веб-приложение&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: React + Vite]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Панель диспетчера, карта, отчёты, админка, рабочее место подрядчика&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="270" width="250" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Прокси nginx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: nginx]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;HTTPS, раздача веба, /api → API, лимит попыток входа, выдача фото&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="245" y="460" width="250" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v23" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Хранилище фото&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: том Docker]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Файлы фото «до» и «после»&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;shape=cylinder3;size=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="455" width="240" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Мониторинг&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: Prometheus + Grafana]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Время ответа, число запросов, ошибки&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="460" width="240" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v25" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API бэкенда&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: Python 3.12, FastAPI, Uvicorn]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Бизнес-логика: заявки, статусы, автообработка, карта, отчёты, справочники&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="245" y="670" width="250" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v26" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;База данных&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: PostgreSQL 16 + PostGIS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Заявки, пользователи, история, улицы, дома, зоны подрядчиков&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;shape=cylinder3;size=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="660" width="240" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v27" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ML-сервис&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Контейнер: Python, HTTP]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Находит яму на фото, определяет класс и число ям. Делает другой участник команды&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#438DD5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="670" width="240" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v28" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FCM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Внешняя система, этап 2]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Push на Android&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#BBBBBB;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;dashed=1;points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="905" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="&lt;b&gt;Использует&lt;/b&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1.2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;endSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v16" target="v20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="&lt;b&gt;Использует&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;[браузер]&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#404040;strokeWidth=1.2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;endSize=10;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v17" targe